      "files": {
        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n\n<html>\n  <head>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\" />\n\n  </head>\n\n  <body>\n    \n    <!--Content for index.html-->\n    <h1>Maria's Hair Co.</h1>\n    <h3> About me</h3>     \n    <p><img src=\"hair.jpeg\"/>Hi my name is Maria. I have 4 siblings and they are all younger then me, so I like to do their hair and my own hair when my mom or my step-dad doesn't have time. </p>\n    <p>On this website, I'm going to be talking about hair and how to manage it.</p>\n    <h6>Image is public domain - CC0</h6>\n\n\n    <!--Content to move to new page-->\n    <h2> Tips For Curly Hair...</h2>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Always comb your hair from the bottom of your hair and work your way up.</li>\n      <li> Trim regulary to avoid split ends and unhealthy hair.</li>\n      <li> You should rely most on wide-tooth combs - never a brush detangler, because you would end up damaging and possibly losing hair.</li>\n      <li> Always apply conditioner to the ends of your hair.</li>\n      <li> Don't use your shampoo too often because even though you are cleaning it, you can take lots of moisture out of your hair.</li>\n    </ul>\n    <h2> Tips For Straight hair...</h2>\n    <ul>\n      <li> Make sure to find the RIGHT conditioner for your hair.</li>\n      <li> Don't overuse a product becuase straight hair can only hold so much.</li>\n      <li>Gurad your hair from statis as much as you can!</li>\n      <li>Keep your styling kind of simple becuase your hair isn't going to be able to hold really tight hairstyles.</li>\n      <li>Avoid brushing wet hair as it may cause hair to stretch or break off.</li>\n    </ul>\n    <h2> Tips For Hair In General...</h2>\n    <ul> \n      <li>Oil your hair with a light natural oil daily.</li>\n      <li> You can use a cotton T-shirt to dry your hair when wet.</li>\n      <li>Teasing your hair could damage it.</li>\n      <li>Avoid pulling hair tight by the scalp.</li>\n      <li>Massage your scalp to stimulate your hair follicles 2-3 times a week.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    \n    <!--Leave these tags on the index.html page.-->\n  </body>\n</html>\n",
          "active": false,
          "folderId": "0"
        },
